<title>AUSTRALIA: KPN again extends TNT bid.</title>
<headline>KPN again extends TNT bid.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch postal and telecommunications group Koninklijke PTT Nederland NV (KPN) said on Monday it had extended the closing date on its A$2.0 billion bid for TNT Ltd by nine days to December 12.</p>
<p>KPN said it was entitled to 32.5 percent of the global transport and express freight company's issued ordinary shares and 22.6 percent of converting preference shares.</p>
<p>TNT has welcomed the bid of A$2.45 for shares in each class.</p>
<p>The bid's closing date was extended from November 19 about two weeks ago.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
